  "content": "<p>我將Fargo的魔石飾品轉換為具有我的世界風格的靈魂石飾品！這些飾品的強度不如Fargo原版，因此可以將其視為使用Fargo材質和相似名稱的模組。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5769d77a-a928-4687-8580-5b4eb04c72a6.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_46878e63-0d10-4acb-9e99-9be6e7a23187.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1b9e6435-651a-43dc-9a83-c937ba37d942.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bbc7fab0-1862-4fa3-afae-07cc27f3be7e.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3173d1b5-1849-4950-81f1-4c2bd6322894.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2be692db-f295-42ba-a607-8ffb7a71c1b0.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>",
